摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"为 DSH 增加桌面通知提醒","id":"gh:1323599380","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-web-ui-notify","slug":"bill9109/dsh-web-ui-notify","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# dsh-web-ui-notify — Desktop notifications for approvals / questions / turn completion"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**Install:** `dsh plugin --profile web add github:omdsh-dev/dsh-web-ui-notify`"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A DeepSeek Harness Web UI client plugin: when a tool needs approval, DSH asks you a question, or a"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" turn finishes while you are looking at another tab, it pops a system desktop notification — so neit"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"her DSH nor you end up waiting.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"While you browse other pages, DSH needs human confirmation (tool approvals, questions) or finishes a"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" round of work, and the Web UI in the foreground tab is the only place it asks. If you are looking a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"nywhere else, the request waits silently. This plugin moves those moments onto your desktop: a nativ"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"e system notification appears, names the session, and clicks back into the conversation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Notify on interaction with the current session**: tool approvals and DSH questions carry context"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" in the body (approvals show the over-permission reason, questions show the question text)\n- **Notif"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"y on background sessions too**: sessions you are not looking at also notify when they need approval "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"or a question (same contextual body as the current session); a finished background session notifies "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"as well — click it to jump straight to that session\n- **Notify on turn completion**: every finished "},{"id":"p8s6","text":"turn of the current session notifies, with the first 80 characters of the final answer; tool-only tu"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"rns without a final answer show the turn number. Completion, interruption, and error turns all notif"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"y\n- **Session name in the title**: every notification title names its session, e.g. \"Refactor databa"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"se · needs approval\"\n- **Click to jump to the session**: clicking a notification not only returns to"},{"id":"p8s10","text":" the DSH page but also opens that session\n- Notifies only while you are away from the tab; when the "},{"id":"p8s11","text":"page is in the foreground DSH already shows its own prompts, so it does not double-notify\n- Each eve"},{"id":"p8s12","text":"nt notifies once — reconnects do not repeat it, and opening a session with history does not replay o"},{"id":"p8s13","text":"ld turns\n- Notifications do not auto-dismiss after a few seconds; they wait for you\n- A toggle lives"},{"id":"p8s14","text":" in Settings → General, following the DSH language (zh/en)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The plugin is a DSH **bundle** (`package.json` declares `dsh.bundle` + `dsh.client`). Install it int"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"o the `web` profile with the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source changes and no hand-w"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"file with the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source changes and no hand-written patch**:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Internally the command runs `pnpm add <spec>` in the profile directory and automatically appends pac"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"kages that declare `dsh.bundle` to `dsh.profile.bundles`. You can also clone it and install from a l"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ocal path (for development — rebuild and it takes effect):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The repository ships its build output (`lib/`), so the plugin works right after installing — no buil"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"d step needed. It has zero runtime dependencies: the browser-side `require`s (react, react/jsx-runti"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"me, ui-slots) resolve through DSH's own frontend module table, not npm."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> Older DSH (before the profile system) installed via `pnpm --filter @deepseek-ai/dsh add` + `config"},{"id":"p15s2","text":".yaml`; since the 20260806 snapshot the profile flow above is the way. If your DSH is still old, use"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" the historical README (visible in git history)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"After installing, **restart the Web UI** (the way you normally start DSH) and refresh the browser pa"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ge — the plugin takes effect."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Upgrade"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"For a local-path installation, run `add` again against the replacement checkout. User settings (the "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Settings → General toggle) live in the profile's Settings provider and survive upgrades."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The command runs `pnpm remove <pkg>` in the profile directory and removes it from `dsh.profile.bundl"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"es`. After uninstalling, restart web and hard-refresh the browser."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"After installation you must also grant browser notification permission, otherwise the plugin stays s"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ilent — without permission the browser simply blocks notifications."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → General → Desktop notifications** and click **Enable**\n2. When the browser asks"},{"id":"p25s2","text":", choose Allow; the status becomes \"Enabled\"\n3. On macOS, also allow your browser under **System Set"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"tings → Notifications**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then switch to another tab — approvals, questions, or finished turns produce system notifications, a"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"nd clicking one brings you back to handle it."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The settings row has four states:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Status | Meaning |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Enabled | Working normally |\n| Not granted | Click the button to grant |\n| Blocked by browser | Pr"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"eviously denied — change the site setting back to Allow; the button alone will not help |\n| Unsuppor"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ted | The environment has no Notification API |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Symptom | Resolution |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| No notifications appear | Confirm the toggle in Settings → General is Enabled, the browser permiss"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ion for the DSH site is Allow, and on macOS the browser is allowed under System Settings → Notificat"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ions; then switch to another tab — the plugin only notifies while you are away |\n| Notifications wor"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ked, then stopped after a restart | The browser may have reset site permissions; re-grant, or re-ena"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"ble the toggle if the settings row shows a different state |\n| \"Blocked by browser\" | The site permi"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"ssion was previously denied — change it back to Allow in the browser's site settings; clicking Enabl"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"e alone will not help |\n| \"Unsupported\" | The environment has no Notification API (e.g. an old or un"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"usual browser); desktop notifications cannot work there |\n| Plugin not in Settings → General after i"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"nstall | The plugin only appears after the Web UI is restarted and the page hard-refreshed; verify t"},{"id":"p32s10","text":"he bundle row is in the profile (`dsh --profile web --dump-config | grep web-ui-notify`) |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Development and verification"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"`pnpm run build` emits the host + client bundles into `lib/`, which is committed so consumers instal"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"l without building. The test suite covers plugin wiring on a real cordis context and the settings ro"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"w in jsdom. Changes that alter the plugin's visible surface (which events notify, the settings row, "},{"id":"p35s4","text":"locales) should add or update coverage in `tests/`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Community and About"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- Use GitHub Issues for reproducible bugs, focused feature requests, and usage questions.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
